-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっ、学校学校‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっ、質問回答質問回答‼\n...............\nまりちゃんは通学用に\nどんなバッグ使ってるの ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イーストボーイの合皮黒のスクールバッグ♪♪\nストラップ一個‼\nシンプル派"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんの好きな食べ物何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、最近はいちごです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つに絞れないからはまってるものにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴよぴよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、報告"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手の生のトマトとアボガドを\n自ら食べるようになりました‼\nおいしさがわかった:D\n成長したでしょ⁇ほめてほめて←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら、ベビたんみたいに、\nファッションセンスが、良くなりますかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぁぁありがとうです‼\n自分がすきって思うものは\n着てみるのがいちばんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/8517536/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br